          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Infernal Eye"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(divine, divination)\n\nThe zebub records everything they see, and though they don't remember all observations, they can pass them along to another creature. The zebub replays 10 minutes of witnessed events to a touched willing creature, which receives the memories in a flash of information. By remaining in contact, the zebub can spend additional 3-action activities to replay more information. After relaying their visions to another, the zebub can't ever recall those events again."
            },
